builder design pattern is used to create complex object
having high number of optional parameter in step by step


it consist of 5 main componensts

1) Product - this is product that consist of many fields (In this example - computer is product)
2) Builder interface - containing various abstract methods for creating product in steps (
3) Concrete Builder - define each steps methods and return product also (in this cae GamingComputerBuilder)
4) Director  - uses builder class to create product by using required step(in this case ComputerDirecor)
5) Client

